// The named triangle tile shapes (free polyiamonds with 1 to 6 cells: 1, 1, 1, 3, 4 and 12 of them), as patterns in the triangle
// grid's (row, column) coordinates (see topology.js): rows of X (tile cell) and . (empty), separated by '/'; cell (r, c) points up
// when r + c is even. A puzzle names one as "tri:i4a". Generated by enumerating every free polyiamond; the letters follow the
// order of that enumeration.
